{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-1","storyName":"彩排日","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"老演员道尔顿的死被制片人格蕾塔强硬地定性为意外，统筹谢莉却认定这与五年前的某件旧事有关。弄假成真的“杀人”让卢西恩回忆起过去剧团长为年幼的自己上的一课。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["格蕾塔","工作人员A","工作人员B","斯蒂芬","米兰妮","道具组长","莫伊拉","谢莉","蒂比","阿布纳","“白英花”","小卢西恩","剧团长","卢西恩"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_62_g3_filmset.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"老道尔顿的死，是个意外——这就是结论。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"医疗组已经收殓他的遗体，调用短驳运输车送回蓝卡坞主城，并向警方报备事故详情。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"谢莉也已经对剩下的所有道具进行了重新检查，排除了一切隐患。大家稍作休整，今天下午剧组就重启拍摄。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"这么快？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"有什么问题吗？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"胶卷可以更换，摄影机坏了还有备用的，可这是死了一个人啊，我们才刚刚擦干地面的血迹，就要......","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"为什么道尔顿明明是去找道具，最后却找到了一把开刃的真刀？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"到底是谁哄骗酒醉的演员自己去找丢失的道具？还是说，其实是有人故意把它塞到了道尔顿的手里？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"哄骗？故、故意塞？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"道尔顿除了爱喝酒容易耽误事，和剧组的大家也没什么私仇，谁会这样做？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"而且那把刀的形制很普通，剧组的厨房、街面的便利店，甚至我们自己的房间，到处都有差不多的......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"我觉得只是有人无心跟道尔顿提了一嘴，他就自己......","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"总之，疑点很多，不是吗？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"那你只能自己去问道尔顿了，“侦探”小姐。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我知道大部分人，包括我，仍沉浸在失去同伴的冲击中，但现在有个最重要的问题摆在面前——","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"拍摄日程已临近尾声。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我们都知道蓝卡坞专用于拍摄的移动地块跟移动城市不同。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"虽然同样受到中心控制塔的管控，但部分调配权限会直接分享给剧组，我们就是受益于此才能将移动地块开出蓝卡坞主城区。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"租赁合约到期之后，摄影棚会陆续关闭，地块将自动返航。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不过，更多操作空间也意味着更高的维护成本。根据我签署的合约，如果要临时延长租赁合约需要支付一大笔违约金——","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"而它会直接分摊到每一个人的工资单上。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"作为制片人，我需要衡量全体成员的得失，保证我们的剧组正常运转。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我同意。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"作为主演兼投资人，我也同意。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不过，这位“侦探”小姐倒是提醒了我，有些责任确实需要追究。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"道具组长？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道具组长","text":"我、我在。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"道具管控，这是你的本职工作，很显然，你存在严重的失职。甚至，整个拍摄过程里，你手下的实习生都比你更早就位。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道具组长","text":"抱、抱歉，格蕾塔女士。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"亲爱的，抱歉没有任何意义。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"即日开除出组。趁我们的移动地块还没开出主城区多远，你可以尽早物色新的工作......别再说什么了，你应该清楚，我已经足够仁慈。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"道具组接下来的工作......我希望交由莫伊拉负责。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我、我......？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"如果你不愿意，也可以选择跟你的组长一起离开剧组，当然我相信你不会做那种愚蠢的决定。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"另外，斯蒂芬，你需要抓紧了。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"《杜邦夫人之死》的结局还差一口气，这是我们的共识。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"按照原计划，你应该在上周交出那几场戏的定稿。显然，拍摄进度马上就要追上你的修改速度。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我还要身兼导演工作，你知道我们这个剧组其实没多让人省心......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"还是没有好的灵感？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#4$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......嗯。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"这是你的原创剧本，这是你最珍爱的故事，给它一个最好的结束吧，亲爱的。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这也是我最在意的事情。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"杜邦夫人在经历一连串的变故后，到底是被哪个洛克菲勒杀死？在什么场景里？以什么姿势？她死前说了什么？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这直接决定了电影的质量。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她怎么在戏里好看地死，决定了我怎么在蓝卡坞漂亮地重生......","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我把我全部的身家都投给这个项目了，两位。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......神会来找我的。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"什么？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"哦，文学评论里有一种说法，说所谓的“灵感”，是指神明直接附身在作者身上，代他写下新生与死亡，毁灭与希望......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"总之，请放心，我会完成这个故事。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"那好，散会，去做准备吧。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","duration":"0.5","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"格蕾塔女士！格蕾塔女士！","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我有很重要的事要找你谈——","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"谢莉，我知道你要说什么，但不是现在。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我得先去看看卢西恩，他才刚来剧组，第一次参与电影拍摄就经历了这么严重的意外......","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我得确保他不会落荒而逃。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"至于你，无论你联想到了什么......忘了它，你想多了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":152,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我......我来负责整个道具组？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"恭喜你啊，莫丽！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"虽然道尔顿刚过世不久——愿他安息，但我真的为你高兴。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我在蓝卡坞的工作时间可比你长多啦，到现在也就只能画画背景板，晋升的机会可是很难得的。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"那是因为蒂比老喜欢把自己的主张加进背景里，所以你们美术组的组长不敢让你负责更多。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"但我只是从开拓区来蓝卡坞谋生的手工爱好者，真的能......","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"格蕾塔女士说你能，你就能！她的眼光可从来没出过错。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"而且你的姐姐也会很高兴的，你不是受她影响才来蓝卡坞的吗？快告诉她你现在已经是独当一面的道具组长啦！","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"等晚上再跟她通话吧。我不能辜负格蕾塔女士的信任，得把工作做好才行。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哦~不错嘛，现在已经开始有组长的样子了哦？说不定再过两天连找你看恐怖片你都不会赏脸啦。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":174},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_62_g1_setting_lobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":181,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#9$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"嘿，别在我眼前晃悠了，谢莉！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"分镜表确认了三次，设备检查了五次。我向制片人女士发过毒誓，不会再弄丢一套摄影机了，可以别盯着我了吗！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"（小声）你说......真的是这样吗？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#6$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"啊，什么？大点声。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你说道尔顿的死真的是意外吗？你就没觉得有什么不对劲的地方？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"关我什么事。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"那个家伙整天把自己泡在酒桶里，这两个月不知道耽误了我多少次下班，现在终于清净了。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"他五年前还没这样。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"废话，那时候他还在格蕾塔和斯蒂芬的片子里担当主演，风头正盛呢，那时候我们不也在吗？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"这就是最不对劲的！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"开筹备会的时候，我在工作人员名单里看到了很多眼熟的名字，实际见到你们的面孔之后更加发怵，就好像——","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"就好像真的回到了五年前，再一次目睹了那名小演员的死？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你不觉得这两起事故......很像吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"哪儿像了？一个是坠亡，一个是道具刀弄错了。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#9$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"谢莉，你又开始神经过敏了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我很理智......哦......我全想明白了！道尔顿不就是当时那起事故的第一责任人吗！","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"他遭到报应了......有人来找他了......","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"停下！别再挠你的手臂也别再胡思乱想了。我早跟你说过——多看医生，远离剧组！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我们不过是拍烂片谋生的普通人，没人把我们当回事儿。谢莉？谢莉，我说的话你听见没！","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我听见了......我听见了......有什么要来了，要来找我们了......","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":220},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"charslot","id":223},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_bg_24_RL_castlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":230,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"你需要在脑海中构想下刀的位置和角度。","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"右腹下方是脏器的间隙，血供丰富但不致命。你可以借他人之血抒情，为之后的高潮段落欲扬先抑。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"或者将刀尖上移，刺穿胸腔。","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"脆弱的肺叶没有任何抵抗能力，对方会慢慢溺死在自己的血和你慷慨激昂的独白之中。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"举起你的匕首，孩子。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"想想我们已经排演过的段落，你一直表现得很好，只差这最后一步。","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"刺下去！让刀尖体会搅动内脏、割断血管的触感，让它聆听心跳的声音！","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"你害怕了？","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"......平庸的孩子。","id":248},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他并非胆怯，只是心有不解。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"剧团长，他到现在还不愿练习刺杀，握住匕首后就再没说过话了。","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","focus":"l","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"辛苦你了，去为明天的演出准备吧。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......我来指导这个孩子。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“白英花”","text":"您亲自......我明白了。","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"孩子，匕首重吗？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......重。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"但你知道，它的重量并不来自金属和装饰，而是源自你的心，对吗？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"头发遮住了男孩的眉眼，他沉默着点头。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"“白英花”未能料到你领悟得如此之快，你在等她解惑，而她做不到。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"听我说，孩子......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长握住了卢西恩的小手，他的微笑是温柔的，但手上明显用了力道，不容拒绝。","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩觉得自己僵硬的手指在慢慢放松。","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"忘掉“白英花”试图教你的那些技巧，你不需要模仿某一种握刀姿势或是刺杀方法。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"没有不染血的匕首、不被击发的弩，握紧它们就好。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它们不是道具，它们会教会你该渴望什么。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"所以，让它们牵引你的行动，别怀疑，哪怕它指向的对象是你没有想过的人——亲友、挚爱，甚至自己......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"或者，此刻站在你面前的我。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"你......你？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"别犹豫，挥下去。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"试试？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"（摇头）","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"试试。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"（摇头）","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"试试。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"那你，那我......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"我们在扮演什么？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"既然已经遗忘了技巧，那角色和台词也暂且忘记吧，它们只是戏剧的载体，而非戏剧本身。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩终于握紧了刀，剧团长放开了他的手，半跪在他身前，让两人保持差不多的高度。","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"可是，我们离得太近太近了......","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你害怕伤到我吗？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"没关系，孩子。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"连这种情绪也一并遗忘吧。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"相信我，你会沉浸，你会触碰到戏剧的美。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"看着剧团长，卢西恩生出了强烈的疑惑——这是否是自己第一次见到他？","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"他理解不了对方说的所有话，他甚至怀疑这个菲林男人其实并不存在。","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"自己的心脏在跳动，卢西恩可以确定。","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"是了，心跳不会作假，心跳会给他答案。","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"他要以什么方式去询问？","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长微笑着，他在无声地鼓励自己。","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"答案显而易见。","id":330},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩毫不犹豫地挥刀——","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":333},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_02_s","x":"170","y":"-100","rox":"-30","roy":"89","roz":"150","layer":"1","id":334},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"感受到了吗？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩的手在颤抖，一击之后，他差点脱力，险些握不住刀柄。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长没有移动分毫，甚至连表情都没有变化。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"但卢西恩很确信刀刃划开了对方的身体，他听到了声音......他感受到了本不属于他的疼痛，强烈的，肆意的疼痛。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"来到剧团后，他一直沉默，但此刻，那疼痛让他突然想要歌唱。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"这是你的第一课，孩子——所有的故事最终都只会剩下某种情绪，或者......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长停顿了一下，卢西恩投去追问的目光，于是他对上了那对金色的瞳孔。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"某段密不可分的关系。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你是天生的演员，你应该成为我的学生。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"考虑好之后，来找我......卢西恩，我永远不会成为你的阻碍。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":363},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩低头看向自己的双手。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"手套上的血迹早已清洗干净，但他依然无法忘记从道尔顿手中夺过刀时的感觉。","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"沉醉、忘我。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"正如他的师长第一次教他使用匕首时他的复杂感受。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"忘记纯熟的刺杀技巧，仅用浓烈的情绪点燃自我，只剩下两个灵魂彼此撕咬。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"将生命收束于亦真亦假的小刀，赐予对方完美的终局——","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"死亡。","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"请进。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"卢西恩。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"格蕾塔女士。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你的脸色有点差......你还好吗？","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":404},{"type":"image","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406}],"characters":["格蕾塔","工作人员A","工作人员B","斯蒂芬","米兰妮","道具组长","莫伊拉","谢莉","蒂比","阿布纳","“白英花”","小卢西恩","剧团长","卢西恩"]}